{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a survival adventure with a cozy atmosphere! You wake up in a mysterious world with no memory, and so your journey begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you need to survive\u2014gather food, go fishing, and build a home. You can choose to live in solitude or recruit villagers to establish a thriving tribe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a world full of beauty, though not without peril. As you explore the wilds, you'll encounter various monsters. Craft gear, learn magic, and defeat them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel far and wide, search for clues, and unravel the mystery of how you ended up in this world. Or simply lie back and embrace a quiet pastoral life\u2014the choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[GIF]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration &amp; Treasure Hunting </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[GIF]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunting </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[GIF]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooking </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[GIF]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[GIF]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle monsters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[GIF]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interdimensional Exploration, Venture into eroded dreamscapes and collect rare artifacts from lost times </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[GIF]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Marketplace, Turn your surplus into new resources </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[GIF]</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326670?t=1764504360","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326670/8452d43ac6c3a6a5b28c7a5d2e87c43248df4601/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764504360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326670/0434f32198aa24e4e73b4991517aed416aa29b36/capsule_231x87.jp